    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHbS-B1Ws-VCChpk7_DkmJRhPdgFgVdyXW5XKOJa-6fVCaJshn6lcMYOSNOBLbupptk1sA9u1xDJ6VkORuvE9UrlV4kMCVVMh2AcjDdA64wvC_OSPpD5npN0Sb5JHue28253bD-ZTcdY5Wq3hGq-gfGkGWwIaY7tzhROA4ne9DAFxJeduaZoN40FVjN-kyfy6I7ZN_ly-awl-E="
      title: "reddit.com"
    }
    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFf0_0Xut8Mco2bOj9_g_RoZqhhyGCZDZ621JO5sPD-uh0kcwRgdNB0eL2F5B2QT7Oi2g84hQcXH46gvui_hc-ItyQ8tmx7EaIybzwdlCVWOaTamRDCBJ1D98mbqUqQlEiokADAaEKSYs7h9RIkP1leENb88dWFyYzOy8B2s6boYenFE_3HRLIFmeS5M39I0Wd5XzduTPq4cr76M7JJT2Sa"
      title: "stackoverflow.com"
    }
    summary: "The error \"Cannot set property fetch of #<Window> which has only a getter\" in a React Vite project typically occurs when there is an attempt to redefine or assign a new value to the `window.fetch` property, which is a read-only global API[1][2][3][4][5]. This often happens in specific scenarios, most notably during unit testing or due to conflicting library configurations.\n\nHere are the primary causes and solutions:\n\n**1. Mocking `fetch` in Testing Environments (e.g., Jest)**\nThis is the most common reason for this error. When writing unit tests for components that make network requests using the `fetch` API, developers often mock `global.fetch` to control the responses and prevent actual API calls. However, directly assigning to `global.fetch` can trigger this error because `fetch` on the `window` object has a getter but no setter[1][6][7][8][9].\n\n*   **Solution:** When using Jest, it\'s recommended to mock `fetch` within your test setup, ensuring you restore it afterward. A common pattern involves:\n    *   Using `jest.fn()` to create a mock function.\n    *   Assigning `global.fetch = jest.fn()` inside a `beforeEach` block.\n    *   Restoring the original `fetch` using `jest.restoreAllMocks()` or `global.fetch.mockRestore()` in an `afterEach` block[1][8].\n    *   You can then chain `mockResolvedValueOnce` or `mockRejectedValueOnce` to your `jest.fn()` to simulate successful or failed API responses[6][8].\n    *   For example:\n        \n\nSources:\n[1] [stackoverflow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHoyrjh2lon36Io2P78m6uvxvgLJhr5JLFbGr8y_CO_K1oxQpnftq2F9-PhPp0H4LpypB4_N0WKyLPBlrL2qHLrBWwXF-cwclMusGYsptoU3jv9Chr5rYdPI2UeLX_tJ1uFtlqEuNq0pK3eIrToAysHqY4f4B7JYu9C2XoiFICyUfGvKcRVkMfrMssz_2ptkNq719FFDg==)\n[2] [google.dev](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF0cp1Z3q1KqEVI0fFlRV35AVHfNAA-8Qf64gkwFNSu7VPWOvh-R3Gga0NrzS-g-0_mGM6FYg47_Ft3liL-1GGq2nhr5uceaP491L68dNXdtXnCEQX108z08GCP3jQaaZ3tF33C_BZa3iY6htX6YnYaf3FlTCDYskSC4HuILtFCMDzkDI3g2Je-dH4Ss873vsbVS8g2RZTqPeQWLH7CvPcbcPgHIdVO5VMuCDo1U-rnVQ==)\n[3] [stackoverflow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGI-o2_GpjH5FSiE6Gd863Y2yR1MDdJrIVDnAxNp9QzZLGa6dyHIdQ0kqjcni3SpmGaIS9XIONKC1k6bROn3drcymYTQxdscywGK_iOkhfGGYBiaDS-IG8_pBat6brrO35stx8Dx98577j6V9YJsxwNYc62X6bHVkqBsOeao1gt0oCbJngPO7_1RD4a4V93Bd1ang9QkHjoZRLoF7_f4nSKRR6eD2htWNsYaB7baH9U8mSf)\n[4] [stackoverflow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG8Y4NBqEyWkdmKpSz5_RQOKSxX38BZ6tTTZiTmtCrmfLhhmVp_TXoHqOHIgB7C9HxW-AXVSbZhhGSrBELcTq6eY-s34v0rUw6mRU2hb1-_4RQdhPtVNDv5DdJgwQTEIc80LGdwv2kGUHzPuvJjZO6jzMl1SU8R1K5ExO2VoAuWvCUth8L-weMRnnWj5Id6cDlrCCLSqjw6AjLRdyV864mB)\n[5] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHf68HvmmJE-aw7txDF2W1ktkrmfguXpDC3Qy2EGFeiBV2fkK2yiTtXOnxri0oBQaqNhLGxclp4SdbdOW8HJdIUxiuKepEqrw0k80zTgHJmGFflrO7fO6CWEosUN2CH7Yzq_fgdfI4=)\n[6] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFo68nqb--9DfIKU2IWnU95YvZYPkb-N8NSpUuBu6isSnNzekVOd6XleX_BpuoUFgcepYEy3RWp1QWSpng3itXv1he-pGTsRDXRqhi4zzr8KBT1iAHAgK6sI0DAi3EcdFKaeDnMmy9ADH9GTJ1jQTVPWDRnMih2PFKI4RxmNNpiqtyzzRnBXWCD)\n[7] [reactnativeschool.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHRCOZq_FdNsY9TJJLpTO8vQwnF5gTP4Ow4qVb2CD7CN4dYjIf7mHxmZKDaOc35hHTBIL3AOuWXDjB_-p0gpz2QZsImATA2kNZt7QOVE08iSehE_8DK13ZYB4h_Q214DqeCpqpbjvYA87jlEF9kf06eLmZUsqLZio-DxzbJiHxfqS-EEA9i)\n[8] [itnext.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFX8TvzVHjZoncsl2ytJt5YhYfrqqzlaj4p_npr339z-Uljqna-xPYe2MVciUXnJHAGr01cCWszvdXoCDI2-6pZD6iyTF13eRe5VsWzB0ooq1HnUkOwHUs-qcN51MrYLqQihdXdhWV-H-8IwrpMoDtzxblXiqs9w3C4M8l7UFS3E75vZ1gq7oFj4lJvNVXiUqg=)\n[9] [reddit.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHbS-B1Ws-VCChpk7_DkmJRhPdgFgVdyXW5XKOJa-6fVCaJshn6lcMYOSNOBLbupptk1sA9u1xDJ6VkORuvE9Url