    thinking: "**Adding Gamification Stats**\n\nI\'m working on integrating a new gamification stats module into the existing dashboard grid. I\'m focusing on the component\'s structure within the current layout and starting to consider the data points to be visualized. I\'m planning to introduce the module as a new element, keeping the existing structure in place.\n\n\n**Integrating New Progress**\n\nI\'ve decided to add the \"visited places\" progression display directly beneath the stats section within the existing layout. I\'m imagining a component that will be visually appealing with a clear weekly report summary. I think it will be a good addition for data visualization.\n\n\n**Considering Widget Addition**\n\nI\'m thinking about replacing the \"Weekly Report\" card or adding a new gamification card to show \"Visited Countries\" with a progress bar. Ultimately, I\'m considering adding a Gamification widget. I\'m focusing on user engagement, and how this new data can improve my dashboard\'s overall appeal.\n\n\n**Updating World Explorer**\n\nI\'m now integrating the \"World Explorer\" data visualization. I\'ve built out a progress bar and level display with animation effects. My focus is on making it visually appealing and engaging. I\'ve now added a shimmer effect to the progress bar.\n\n\n"
